[{"speaker":"","text":"嘶！","art":{"background":"a3082","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-4"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「啊！」","art":{"background":"a3083","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"最终释放在了小雨的体内。","art":{"background":"a3083","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"白浊液的量大得我自己都难以相信，甚至从小雨的下面漫了出来。","art":{"background":"a3083","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"我的精液与小雨的爱液和破处血混在一起，变成淡淡的粉色。","art":{"background":"a3083","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-4"}]